      <article data-history-node-id="3727">

  
    

  
  <div>
    
	<div class="usa-prose">
		<p>How much do you know about food and agriculture? What about rural America or conservation? ERS has assembled a group of charts and maps covering key information about the <a href="/data-products/ag-and-food-statistics-charting-the-essentials/ag-and-food-sectors-and-the-economy" data-entity-type="node" data-entity-uuid="a48eda4a-525b-4415-b9ea-f41f967f2e40" data-entity-substitution="canonical" title="Ag and Food Statistics: Charting the Essentials - Ag and Food Sectors and the Economy" class="usa-link">farm and food sectors</a>, including <a href="/data-products/ag-and-food-statistics-charting-the-essentials/agricultural-production-and-prices" data-entity-type="node" data-entity-uuid="fdfe7082-a673-4a80-b78e-dfc201ad86e6" data-entity-substitution="canonical" title="Ag and Food Statistics: Charting the Essentials - Agricultural Production and Prices" class="usa-link">agricultural markets</a> and <a href="/data-products/ag-and-food-statistics-charting-the-essentials/agricultural-trade" data-entity-type="node" data-entity-uuid="eccb8d80-30d3-4e57-a421-c2bc37eb41f0" data-entity-substitution="canonical" title="Ag and Food Statistics: Charting the Essentials - Agricultural Trade" class="usa-link">trade</a>, <a href="/data-products/ag-and-food-statistics-charting-the-essentials/farming-and-farm-income" data-entity-type="node" data-entity-uuid="257b3bc7-9684-4b5e-a97d-310df54d97ed" data-entity-substitution="canonical" title="Ag and Food Statistics: Charting the Essentials - Farming and Farm Income" class="usa-link">farming and farm income</a>, <a href="/data-products/ag-and-food-statistics-charting-the-essentials/food-prices-and-spending" data-entity-type="node" data-entity-uuid="1045e4c4-a171-49a9-bcc5-38ff3b160154" data-entity-substitution="canonical" title="Ag and Food Statistics: Charting the Essentials - Food Prices and Spending" class="usa-link">food prices</a> and <a href="/data-products/ag-and-food-statistics-charting-the-essentials/food-availability-and-consumption" data-entity-type="node" data-entity-uuid="f693a9f1-5c66-4511-9812-a84b5bfc5cc5" data-entity-substitution="canonical" title="Ag and Food Statistics: Charting the Essentials - Food Availability and Consumption" class="usa-link">consumption</a>, <a href="/data-products/ag-and-food-statistics-charting-the-essentials/food-security-and-nutrition-assistance" data-entity-type="node" data-entity-uuid="7a53d8a6-4f93-423c-9f02-171e78d094c9" data-entity-substitution="canonical" title="Ag and Food Statistics: Charting the Essentials - Food Security and Nutrition Assistance" class="usa-link">food security and nutrition assistance</a>, <a href="/data-products/ag-and-food-statistics-charting-the-essentials/rural-economy" data-entity-type="node" data-entity-uuid="c6cbc03e-9680-4951-b8eb-c304d7786fa0" data-entity-substitution="canonical" title="Ag and Food Statistics: Charting the Essentials - Rural Economy" class="usa-link">rural economies</a>, and the interaction of agriculture and <a href="/data-products/ag-and-food-statistics-charting-the-essentials/land-and-natural-resources" data-entity-type="node" data-entity-uuid="aa0861c1-c59a-455f-98e5-dfd30de1037e" data-entity-substitution="canonical" title="Ag and Food Statistics: Charting the Essentials - Land and Natural Resources" class="usa-link">natural resources</a>.</p>
<p>How much, for example, do agriculture and related industries contribute to U.S. gross domestic product and account for U.S. jobs? What share of the U.S. land base is in agricultural uses? Which commodities are the leading agricultural exports? How much of the food dollar goes to farmers? How do poverty rates in rural areas compare with metro areas? These are among the statistics covered in this collection of charts and maps—with accompanying text—divided into the nine section titles listed at left.</p>
<p>Use the navigation to the left to view the full chart collection.</p>
<p>ERS also periodically publishes a booklet of selected <em>Essentials</em> charts and maps, for the latest edition see:</p>
<ul>
<li><a href="/publications/108460" class="usa-link">Selected Charts from Ag and Food Statistics: Charting the Essentials, 2024</a> (AP-121, February 2024)</li>
</ul>
